  "notes": "Compound of {分|ぶん} (to divide) + {配|ぱい} (to distribute). Used in economic, social, and everyday contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {分配|ぶんぱい}する (to distribute, to allocate)\n- {利益|りえき}の{分配|ぶんぱい} (profit distribution)\n- {富|とみ}の{分配|ぶんぱい} (distribution of wealth)\n- {所得|しょとく}{分配|ぶんぱい} (income distribution)\n- {再|さい}{分配|ぶんぱい} (redistribution)\n- {均等|きんとう}に{分配|ぶんぱい}する (to distribute evenly)\n- {分配|ぶんぱい}{金|きん} (dividend, distribution payment)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {分配|ぶんぱい}: distributing shares to multiple recipients (emphasis on giving portions to each)\n- {配分|はいぶん}: allocation, apportioning (emphasis on deciding how much goes where)\n- {配布|はいふ}: handing out, distributing (printed materials, goods — not dividing a total)",
